#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:2
msgid "Configure Studio"
msgstr "配置 Studio"

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Open the separate Settings window to configure models, Studio "
"preferences, extensions, development environments, worktrees, and local "
"resources."
msgstr "打开独立的设置窗口，配置模型、Studio 偏好、扩展、开发环境、worktree 和本地资源。"

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"Settings are grouped by user task. You do not need to configure every "
"page; start with **Provider**, **Default model**, **Development "
"environments**, and **Godot Projects** for a basic Godot workflow."
msgstr ""
"设置按用户任务分组。不需要配置每个页面；要开始基本的 Godot 工作流，请先设置 **Provider**、**Default "
"model**、**Development environments** 和 **Godot Projects**。"

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:22
msgid "Settings groups"
msgstr "设置分组"

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:24
msgid "The Settings window uses five groups:"
msgstr "设置窗口包含五个分组："

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:26
msgid "**Models** — **Provider** and **Default model**;"
msgstr "**Models** — **Provider** 和 **Default model**；"

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Studio** — **General**, **Appearance**, **Keyboard shortcuts**, "
"**Search**, **Statistics**, and **Personalization**;"
msgstr ""
"**Studio** — **General**、**Appearance**、**Keyboard "
"shortcuts**、**Search**、**Statistics** 和 **Personalization**；"

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:29
msgid "**Extensions** — **MCP Servers**, **Skills**, **Hooks**, and **Plugins**;"
msgstr "**Extensions** — **MCP Servers**、**Skills**、**Hooks** 和 **Plugins**；"

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Workspace** — **Browser**, **Computer use**, **Development "
"environments**, **Worktrees**, and **Godot Projects**;"
msgstr "**Workspace** — **Browser**、**Computer use**、**Development "
"environments**、**Worktrees** 和 **Godot Projects**；"

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Resources** — **Documentation**, **Archived sessions**, **Import**, and"
" **About**."
msgstr ""
"**Resources** — **Documentation**、**Archived sessions**、**Import** 和 "
"**About**。"

#: ../../source/settings/index.rst:35
msgid ""
"The group determines where a page appears in the Settings navigation. For"
" example, theme controls belong to **Appearance**, while the global Godot"
" executable belongs to **Development environments**."
msgstr ""
"分组决定页面在设置导航中的位置。例如，主题控制位于 **Appearance**，全局 Godot 可执行文件位于 **Development "
"environments**。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Open the separate Settings window to "
#~ "configure providers, defaults, integrations, "
#~ "appearance, and data-related preferences."
#~ msgstr "打开独立的设置窗口，配置供应商、默认值、集成、外观和数据相关偏好。"
